oatpp-sqlite
------------------------------------------
SQLite adapter for oatpp ORM

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  liboatpp-sqlite1-1.3.0-1bl2
  liboatpp1-1.3.1-1bl2
  libsqlite3_0-3.49.1-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  liboatpp-devel-1.3.1-1bl2
  libsqlite3-devel-3.49.1-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/oatpp/oatpp-sqlite

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/oatpp/oatpp-sqlite/archive/refs/tags/1.3.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack oatpp-sqlite-1.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./oatpp-sqlite-1.3.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/oatpp-sqlite-1.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/oatpp-sqlite-1.3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liboatpp-sqlite1-1.3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liboatpp-sqlite-devel-1.3.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

